<p>A <code>dataTableBody</code> is one part of a
  <a href="/components/data-table/"><code>dataTable</code></a>.
  It maps to the native HTML <code>&lt;tbody&gt;</code>
  element. See the <a href="/components/data-table/">Data Table
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;DataTable caption="User accounts"&gt;
  &lt;DataTableHead&gt;...&lt;/DataTableHead&gt;
  &lt;DataTableBody&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Alice&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;alice@example.com&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Admin&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Bob&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;bob@example.com&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Editor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/DataTableBody&gt;
&lt;/DataTable&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
